  "script": "Audi's recent decision to stop taking A8 orders in 2026 marks a turning point in luxury sedans. The 2023 Mercedes-Benz S580 packs a 4.0-liter twin-turbo V8, churning out 496 horsepower and 516 lb-ft of torque. The suspension system can raise the car by three inches if a side impact is detected, offering extra protection. Introduced in 2021, the W223 S-Class added tech and streamlined design, keeping it ahead. Will this focus on technology keep the S-Class the leader, or does the shift in the market spell change for Mercedes-Benz too?",
