      "Highlights": "THIS... is a 2023 Mercedes-Benz S580, finished in Emerald Green with a Sienna Brown interior. The attached Carfax history report lists no accidents in this Mercedes-Benz's brief past. According to the window sticker provided in the gallery, this S580 carried an original MSRP of $147,850. Factory equipment includes the AMG Line and Warmth and Comfort packages, 20-inch AMG multispoke wheels, an Airmatic air suspension system, a 12.8-inch OLED touchscreen center display, soft-close doors, heated, ventilated, and power-adjustable dynamic front seats, heated, ventilated, and power-adjustable rear seats, an MBUX High End rear entertainment system, a Burmester surround sound system, and more as detailed below. Tinted windows are the only modification reported by the seller. Mercedes-Benz introduced the seventh-generation S-Class (called W223 internally) for the 2021 model year. Their updated flagship added even more technology than its predecessor and is characterized by a more streamlined exterior design. Production continues today. Power comes from a 4.0-liter twin-turbocharged V8, rated at 496 horsepower and 516 lb-ft of torque. Called M176 internally, the engine spins the rear wheels via a 9-speed automatic transmission.",
      "Equipment": "A window sticker is pictured in the gallery, and a partial list of notable equipment includes: Warmth and Comfort Package (heated steering wheel, power outboard rear seats with memory, heated and ventilated outboard rear seats, heated front and rear center and door armrests) AMG Line (AMG wheels and body kit, stainless steel pedals with rubber studs, AMG floor mats) 20-inch AMG multispoke wheels Airmatic air suspension system Dynamic LED headlights Sunroof Soft-close doors Slate high-gloss poplar wood interior trim Wood and leather steering wheel Leather upholstery Power-adjustable steering column 12.3-inch digital instrument cluster 12.8-inch OLED touchscreen center display Power rear sunshades Active ambient lighting Power-operated trunk lid COMAND infotainment system Wireless charging Apple CarPlay capability Burmester High End 4D surround sound system MBUX High End rear entertainment Navigation system Rear-view camera Front and rear parking sensors Blind spot assist Lane keeping assist Active brake assist Active park assist Attention assist Dash camera",
      "Seller Notes": "There is a loan on this vehicle. Sale proceeds will be used to satisfy the loan and allow the seller to transfer the title to the winning bidder. Please contact the seller directly with any questions."
